                                        "entry_id": "30f9d9a5-732c-31aa-8c99-7fc8e8ebe0cc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process of becoming a ghetto, an isolated and underprivileged urban area."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9371dc7b-2c67-4136-afa5-9cd159ed697d",
                                                "sense_id": "bfbe74c9-bd76-3c62-8352-32bbd3cd88ea",
                                                "text": "It's all part of a move toward ghettoization, they charge, an attempt to make the poor feel so shamefully unwanted that they will leave the area."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "35121929-e871-30de-bb6e-6df05b847f71",
                                        "entry_id": "30f9d9a5-732c-31aa-8c99-7fc8e8ebe0cc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process of ghettoizing (a group): the segregation/isolation of a group and placement of that group into a figurative or literal position of little power."
                                        ],
